    "title": "Mivi : Music & AI Video Maker",
    "description": "Create music videos with Mivi AI music video maker! New templates are added regularly to help you get the best editing opportunities.\r\n\r\n<b>Mivi Music Video Maker</b> is a free and easy-to-use application. You only need to upload photos and choose free templates in Mivi video maker, making music videos has never been so easy! \r\n\r\n\u2705Download and try now for free! \r\n<b>Features: </b>\r\n\r\nMivi Music Video Maker simplifies the video creation process and facilitates the process to becoming an influencer on various social media platforms such as YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, WhatsApp, Facebook, and others.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf20Create trendy videos with your photos in just seconds\r\n- More than 20,000 free video templates. You can choose from thousands of templates for quick video output.\r\n- Transform your photos into cool music videos in just one click.\r\n- Regular updates with new, trendy templates.\r\n\r\n\u2728Thousands of Templates and Effects\r\n- Use a variety of filters and outstanding AI technology to turn your creativity into reality. Cartoon filters are available now to make your photos cartoon.\r\n- From trendy transitions to eye-catching animations, Mivi has thousands of options to make your videos stand out. \r\n- There\u2019s a template for every occasion such as making a birthday video, a travel vlog, or a lyrical video etc..\r\n- The effects available are highly popular on Instagram, including neon, spiral, wings, emoji, and heart. Additionally, there are other Magic Effects such as Lightning and Flying Butterfly.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfbcLyrical Video Maker\r\n- Add text to your videos and synchronize it with the music to create beautiful, emotive content.\r\n- You can easily create Birthday Video, Festival Video, Anniversary Video, Lyrical Video, MV Video etc..\r\n\r\n\u2705Download for FREE and Share\r\n- Mivi allows you to quickly download any trending status video for FREE!\r\n- Perfect for sharing on social media or sending to friends and family.\r\n\r\nJoin millions of users who have already discovered the joy of creating with Mivi. Download Mivi - Music & AI Video Maker today and start turning your photos into stunning videos! Create, share, and inspire with the best free video editor on the market.\r\nLet your creativity shine with Mivi. The ultimate music video maker which is free, fun, and easy to use. Download now and become an mv master today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Create music videos with Mivi AI music video maker! New templates are added regularly to help you get the best editing opportunities.<br><br><b>Mivi Music Video Maker</b> is a free and easy-to-use application. You only need to upload photos and choose free templates in Mivi video maker, making music videos has never been so easy! <br><br>\u2705Download and try now for free! <br><b>Features: </b><br><br>Mivi Music Video Maker simplifies the video creation process and facilitates the process to becoming an influencer on various social media platforms such as YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, WhatsApp, Facebook, and others.<br><br>\ud83c\udf20Create trendy videos with your photos in just seconds<br>- More than 20,000 free video templates. You can choose from thousands of templates for quick video output.<br>- Transform your photos into cool music videos in just one click.<br>- Regular updates with new, trendy templates.<br><br>\u2728Thousands of Templates and Effects<br>- Use a variety of filters and outstanding AI technology to turn your creativity into reality. Cartoon filters are available now to make your photos cartoon.<br>- From trendy transitions to eye-catching animations, Mivi has thousands of options to make your videos stand out. <br>- There\u2019s a template for every occasion such as making a birthday video, a travel vlog, or a lyrical video etc..<br>- The effects available are highly popular on Instagram, including neon, spiral, wings, emoji, and heart. Additionally, there are other Magic Effects such as Lightning and Flying Butterfly.<br><br>\ud83c\udfbcLyrical Video Maker<br>- Add text to your videos and synchronize it with the music to create beautiful, emotive content.<br>- You can easily create Birthday Video, Festival Video, Anniversary Video, Lyrical Video, MV Video etc..<br><br>\u2705Download for FREE and Share<br>- Mivi allows you to quickly download any trending status video for FREE!<br>- Perfect for sharing on social media or sending to friends and family.<br><br>Join millions of users who have already discovered the joy of creating with Mivi. Download Mivi - Music &amp; AI Video Maker today and start turning your photos into stunning videos! Create, share, and inspire with the best free video editor on the market.<br>Let your creativity shine with Mivi. The ultimate music video maker which is free, fun, and easy to use. Download now and become an mv master today!",
